# Environment variables for cua-bot-web.
# Copy to .env.local and fill in real values (.env.local is git-ignored).

# ===== Web (Vite) =====
# Backend matchmaker URL. When unset:
#   - dev:  Browser hits relative /rtc, Vite proxies to the URL below (avoids CORS).
#   - prod: Browser hits relative /rtc; the deployed origin must be in the backend CORS allowlist.
# When set explicitly: browser fetches this URL directly (no proxy; CORS must allow origin).
# To target the local mock server, set: VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8787
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.example.com

# ===== Mock server (tools/mock-server.mjs) — optional =====
# Only needed when running `npm run mock` locally.
# When set, the mock will sign real userSigs that can actually join a TRTC room.
# MOCK_SDK_APP_ID=1400000000
# MOCK_SDK_SECRET_KEY=your_sdk_secret_key_here
